      ["Free of adenosine receptor antagonism: 10-fold safer cardiac and CNS profile than theophylline (no sleep disturbance, no palpitations)", "Does not require tedious and expensive serum blood level monitoring (TDM) like theophylline", "Effective oral bronchodilator for patients who cannot master inhaler devices"],
